        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Solomon Benaya guri báy, «Adoosíng inós i kaahi tleehheek, gaaseek, ku fól, as kahhó' tseerér Yoabu aa tawo ku'uús kawa hinges dir'eene nee doó baabuúeene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aakoó Mungú tseerduudá' Yoabu aa ku'umamiís gin ki/is gawaawósuú kilá', asma inós múk tsár oo gan'amuú koóm nee oo hhó' ta inose guna muúx guri tsuú/ ar paánga, ala baabuúeé' Daudi kangwdá' gu xuiiká. Mukwí aa tsuú/ a Abneri garmoó Neri, geeraharusmoó slaqwaruusér Israeli, nee Amasa garmoó Yeterí, geeraharusmoó slaqwaruusér Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daxta tseerdaá mukdá' Yoabu aa tsu/aa/ín nin gawaá Yoabií ki/iyá' nee gawaá xwaylarós ay alhhe'eesay wasle. Ala AAKOÓ MUNGÚ doó Daudi nee xwaylarós nee waawuti'iimarose gin waydií haniís ay kureeraá kureér.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Benaya garmoó Yehoyada iri tláy amór Yoabu, guri gaás, guri foól dír do'ós baraá iisaapoó xaanxaay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo waawutmo Solomon Benaya garmoó Yehoyada guri qaás tawa geeraharusmoó slaqwaruuseerós kitángw Yoabu wa alé. Sadoki guri qaás tawa kaahamusmo kitángw Abiatari wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
