          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala waawutmo Solomon ku tsuuq nee kitángw waawuti'iima oo Daudi i kumaamiit dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE ay alhhe'eesay wasle.»",
          "type": "text",
